{"ID":"20240304114154-lhwrwny","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240304114154-lhwrwny","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240304114154-lhwrwny\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312150341-yvspbx7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312150341-lp0glw0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312150341-lp0glw0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:44,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:44\u0026#125;","title":"【小陷胸汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312150341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312150341-yvspbx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150341-yvspbx7","updated":"20240312150341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百五十二条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150341-34otcv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150341-34otcv3","updated":"20240312150341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「小结胸病」,正在心下,按之则痛,脉浮滑者,「小陷胸汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150341-1xwow04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150341-1xwow04","updated":"20240312150341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按之则痛,意思就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不按不痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大陷胸汤症不按都痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为你结石在里面很深，痰水热结在里面，不按自痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150341-h8yn0oh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150341-h8yn0oh","updated":"20240312150341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 脉浮滑者,「小陷胸汤」主之。脉浮滑者代表里面有热，滑代表里面有痰。结在心下就是结在胃的地方。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150341-gjldbin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150341-gjldbin","updated":"20240312150341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小陷胸汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150341-zf8zl4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150341-zf8zl4q","updated":"20240312150341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连一两，半夏半升洗，栝蒌实大者一个。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150341-u5nq83w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150341-u5nq83w","updated":"20240312150341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味,以水六升,去滓,纳诸药,煮取二升,去滓,分温三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150341-dnjh3w3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150341-dnjh3w3","updated":"20240312150341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄连不要开一两，一两很苦。有时候我开两钱，九碗水煮成三碗。我常常开黄连稍微重一点，为什么？有原因的，黄帝内经说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾苦急的时候，急食苦药以坚之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这句话再加上本草里面说，黄连解毒，解什么毒？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"解尿毒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。尿毒的病人肾苦急，病人头昏，尿里面的毒跑血里面去，跑回心脏里面，苦味入心，大家吃黄连以为是寒凉的，实际黄连是苦味，能够"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"坚肾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以我在治疗病人肾脏有问题的时候，心脏有问题，胃里面太热了一定会用到黄连，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾脏有问题我一定会用到黄连，预防他中毒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，效果很好，病人本来要洗肾了，坚持不洗肾。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150341-gcrl8rt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150341-gcrl8rt","updated":"20240312150341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏生用，半夏吃了如果声音没了，吃点姜就解掉了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"栝蒌实用来开结。什么结，有两个结，一个是痰造成的结，一个是气造成的结"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以在治心脏病的时候也会用到栝蒌实，心脏痛，结在里面痛的时候，会用到栝蒌实。痰结的时候，也可以用，如果痰很多的时候，会用半夏去痰去水，栝蒌实开结，黄连苦味入心能够去热，合并在一起，也就是得到小陷胸汤的人一定中焦有热，同时有水，有痰，结在这个中间，胃很不舒服。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150341-p0vp4pb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150341-p0vp4pb","updated":"20240312150341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小陷胸汤症本来也是该发表，没有发表就攻里，造成结在这个地方。每个人体质不一样，你误攻下以后，产生的后遗症不一样，有的人需要大陷胸汤，有的人需要小陷胸汤。临床上看，小陷胸汤即使没有被误下，肠胃里有问题的时候，看病人舌苔，看舌苔是看胃气，舌苔是黄的，里面有热，喉咙有痰音，痰水，已经可以开小陷胸汤了。不一定非是有结胸才可以开，结胸是胸下，所以小陷胸汤常常用在肠胃方面，效果也很好，但是你一定要确定他胃是热的。如果是寒的，开个黄连下去太冷了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150341-lp0glw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150341-lp0glw0","updated":"20240312150341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上，黄连开一钱，半夏开五钱，栝蒌实开五钱。我常常黄连用两钱，其他用五钱。比例是这样。"}]}]}